# Hospital Appointment
# Example Business Knowledge expressed in Menata Language
# Domain: Hospital — a scheduled visit, the first case needing a real Calendar view
# (CAP-V07, previously registered with no case evidence at all)
# Case 20 of the Case Portfolio (runtime/case-portfolio.md)
# References: hospital-patient.menata

Appointment

Fields

- Patient : Patient
- Doctor : User
- Scheduled At : Date Time
- Status : Scheduled | Completed | Cancelled | No Show
- Reason : Text

Constraints

- Patient is required.
- Doctor is required.
- Scheduled At is required.

Permissions

Clinician

- Schedule
- Cancel

Views

- Appointment Form : Form
- Doctor Calendar : Calendar
- Appointment Detail : Detail
